Package: httransfer
Version: 1.0.0-alpha.10
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HTTransfer Team <wujupeng@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libstdc++6 (>= 12)
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: High-Performance Local File Copy Engine (Self-Contained)
 HTTransfer is a world-class local file copy engine, similar to
 FastCopy / TeraCopy / Robocopy (GUI version).
 .
 This is a self-contained package with all runtime dependencies bundled.
 Install with: dpkg -i httransfer_1.0.0-alpha.10_amd64.deb
 No internet connection or pre-installed dependencies required.
